  "description": "Whole exome sequencing and targeted sequencing data of 308 normal melanocytes samples from human skin. In addition to data retrieved from four different articles, the study is part of a broader analysis involving three distinct cell types, with findings stratified accordingly (see related <a href=\"https://www.cbioportal.org/study/summary?id=skin_fibroblast_2024\">fibroblasts</a> and <a href=\"https://www.cbioportal.org/study/summary?id=normal_skin_keratinocytes_2024\">keratinocytes</a> studies).",
